Package: RBigKinds
Title: BigKinds Data Analysis Toolkit for R
Version: 0.5.2
Authors@R:
  person("Jaeseong", "Choe", email = "cjssoote@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a low-code toolkit for analysing news article data
    exported from BigKinds, the Korean news big-data service, including
    keyword frequency, TF-IDF, clustering, topic modelling, association
    rules and co-occurrence network analysis.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://sorrychoe.github.io/RBigKinds/, https://github.com/sorrychoe/RBigKinds
BugReports: https://github.com/sorrychoe/RBigKinds/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2)
